# There is intentionally no hand-transcribed local relation list here.
#
# The local algebra is the group algebra kN itself (over a splitting field),
# and a QPA relation list depends on the basis selected by GAP.  Run
# scripts/build_local_from_group.g to construct N, form B_0(kN), and obtain a
# reproducible isomorphic QPA quotient with AlgebraAsQuiverAlgebra.
# The resulting quotient is saved as results/local_principal_GF8.qpa.
